span>Awaken.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="awakening"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box three"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/awakening">Awakening</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/awakening">The Deep Sea</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>This was the start of a war— No, the awakening of a new world.</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Feed.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="queen-of-the-monsters"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box four"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/queen-of-the-monsters">Queen of the Monsters</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/queen-of-the-monsters">The Open Ocean</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>It's been a while since we last saw you, hasn't it?</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Raise.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="critter-profile-cappi"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box six"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/critter-profile-cappi">Critter Profile: Cappi!</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/critter-profile-cappi">An Intermission</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb"><strong>&quot;Mr. Wilson, I think we befriended a giant monster.&quot;</strong></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h3><span>Learn.</span></h3> </div> <p><a name="5437"></a></p> <div class="scp-hover-box five"> <div class="container"> <div> <div> <div> <div class="header"> <div class="title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5437">SCP-5437</a></div> <div class="sub-title"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5437">A Beast Cast from Heaven</a></div> </div> <div class="blerb">