&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5755/SCP-XXXX.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot; alt=&quot;SCP-XXXX.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:WIDTH-GOES-HERE;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5755 in the Haron family household.&lt;/p&gt;
