&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-837144-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Examples include koalas, black bears, brown bears, giant pandas and polar bears.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-837144-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. Eparch-class objects are only anomalous by association.&lt;/div&gt;
